---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="About" description={SITE.description} quiet>
  <div class="wrap about">
    <header class="page-head rise">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Kerem Altaylar</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lede">
          Kerem Altaylar is an Istanbul-based sound artist, researcher, and performer
          working in spatial audio and composition, electronic music, audio
          programming, and sonic ecologies.
        </p>

        <p>
          His compositional practice explores sound as a material and perceptual
          phenomenon, especially in its essence of transduction and conduction. He
          builds custom software tools using environments like Web Audio,
          SuperCollider, Max, and JUCE, allowing instrument design and composition to
          develop in tandem.
        </p>

        <p>
          As a live performer working with electronics, live coding, and drumming at
          the intersection of generative systems and rule-based improvisation, he has
          performed at Sonified, Sónar Istanbul, Müze Gazhane, Arter, Algorave
          Istanbul Events, and the Hochschule für Musik, Hannover.
        </p>

        <p>
          He is a PhD Candidate in Sonic Arts at Istanbul Technical University's MIAM
          (Center for Advanced Studies in Music).
        </p>

        <h2>Areas of work</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Multichannel and spatial composition</li>
          <li>Sonic ecologies, bioacoustics and microsoundscapes</li>
          <li>Digital instrument design and audio programming</li>
          <li>Generative systems, artificial life and live coding</li>
          <li>Live electronics and improvisation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <aside class="contact">
        <h3>Contact</h3>
        <p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>

        <h3>Follow</h3>
        <ul class="links">
          {SITE.follow.map((l) => (
            <li><a href={l.href} rel="me noopener">{l.label} →</a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <h3>Also</h3>
        <ul class="links">
          <li><a href="https://www.fxhash.xyz/u/Kerem%20Altaylar" rel="noopener">fxhash →</a></li>
        </ul>

        <p class="cv-link"><a href="/cv/">Full CV →</a></p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 6rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
  }
  .page-head h1 {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 16rem;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  .contact {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 6rem;
  }
  .contact h3 {
    margin-block: 1.8rem 0.7rem;
  }
  .contact h3:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .contact p,
  .links a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .links {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }
  .links a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }
  .cv-link {
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--bdr);
  }
  .cv-link a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .contact {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
